# T46 (row I104b): SAMPLE_LIST and SAMPLE_EXPORT on a module the nuade replayer plays
# (selecta-test.mod, Protracker). Working directory: build/host/tests/m13_samples, so exports stay out of the shared songs fixture dir.
OPEN ../songs/selecta-test.mod
SAMPLE_LIST
SAMPLE_EXPORT 1 nuade-samples-1.8svx
SAMPLE_EXPORT 3 nuade-samples-3.8svx
SAMPLE_EXPORT 1 nuade-samples-1.wav
SAMPLE_EXPORT 9 nuade-samples-9.wav
